  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "In einer grünen Umgebung: beaufsichtigtes Schwimmen, Wandern, Wassersport, Angeln. Verleih von Segeln, Rudern, Kajak, Tretbooten und Mountainbikes, Minigolf, Tennis.Camping, Chalets, Mobilheime, Imbiss.\r\nDas Anzünden von Grills oder Feuer ist verboten."
    ],
    "en": [
      "In a green setting: supervised swimming, hiking, water sports, fishing. Sailing, rowing, kayaking, pedal boats and mountain bikes, mini-golf, tennis, camping, chalets, mobile homes, snack bar.\r\nIt is forbidden to light barbecues or fires."
    ],
    "it": [
      "In un ambiente verde: nuoto sorvegliato, escursioni, sport acquatici, pesca. Vela, canottaggio, kayak, noleggio di pedalò e mountain bike, minigolf, tennis, campeggio, chalet, case mobili, snack bar.\r\nNon sono ammessi barbecue o fuochi."
    ],
    "fr": [
      "Dans un cadre  verdoyant : baignade surveillée, randonnée, sports nautiques, pêche. Location de voile, aviron, Kayak, pédal'eau et VTT, mini-golf, tennis.Camping, chalets, mobile-homes, snack.\r\nInterdiction d'allumer des barbecues ou feu."
    ],
    "nl": [
      "In een groene omgeving: zwemmen onder toezicht, wandelen, watersporten, vissen. Zeilen, roeien, kajakken, verhuur van waterfietsen en mountainbikes, minigolf, tennis, camping, chalets, stacaravans, snackbar.\r\nGeen barbecues of vuur toegestaan."
    ],
    "es": [
      "En un entorno verde: natación vigilada, senderismo, deportes acuáticos, pesca. Vela, remo, kayak, alquiler de hidropedales y bicicletas de montaña, minigolf, tenis, camping, chalets, casas móviles, bar.\r\nNo se permiten barbacoas ni fuegos."
    ]
  },
  "rdfs:label": {
    "fr": [
      "Lac de Devesset : base de loisirs"
    ]
  },
